и, PDF, статистика и анализ (intelligence/)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="420" width="440" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="P23" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="P22" target="P6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="P24" value="Достъп до данните: Spring Data JPA интерфейси, JPQL заявки, Specification за търсене, projections за отчетите." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="590" width="440" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="P25" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="P24" target="P7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="P26" value="Домейн модел: JPA entities (таблици) и enum-и; reports/ и stats/ са обекти за справките, не са таблици." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="470" width="440" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="P27" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="P26" target="P9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="P28" value="Thymeleaf изгледите (View в MVC), CSS и конфигурацията (връзка с БД, JPA, сесии)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="830" width="440" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="P29" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="P28" target="P10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="S" name="5 Поток на заявка"><mxG